  "notes": "{活|い}かす means to effectively utilize something valuable.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Takes を particle: 〜を{活|い}かす\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {経験|けいけん}を{活|い}かす: to make use of experience\n- {能力|のうりょく}を{活|い}かす: to leverage one's abilities\n- {特長|とくちょう}を{活|い}かす: to put one's strengths to use\n- {資源|しげん}を{活|い}かす: to utilize resources\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {活|い}かす: to put to good use (implies effective utilization)\n- {使|つか}う: to use (general, neutral)\n- {利用|りよう}する: to utilize (formal, broader scope)",
